  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Transparency Colombia, kapitlet: ansvarsutkr&#xe4;vande &amp; antikorruption</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transparency for Colombia: accountability &amp; anticorruption</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen med Transparencia por Colombia (det lokala kapitlet av Transparency International) syftar till att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra kontrollen &#xf6;ver den offentliga f&#xf6;rvaltningen f&#xf6;r att g&#xf6;ra den mer transparent, ansvarsfull och inriktad p&#xe5; fredsbyggande och det gemensamma b&#xe4;sta genom att:

f&#xf6;respr&#xe5;ka &#xf6;kad &#xf6;ppenhet, ansvar och j&#xe4;mlikhet i tillg&#xe5;ngen till offentlig f&#xf6;rvaltning,

f&#xf6;lja upp den kontroll som ut&#xf6;vas av r&#xe4;ttsv&#xe4;sendet och oberoende kontrollorgan &#xf6;ver den offentliga f&#xf6;rvaltningen i korruptions&#xe4;renden,

fr&#xe4;mja medborgarnas tillg&#xe5;ng till det offentliga rummet och f&#xf6;respr&#xe5;ka effektivare skyddsmekanismer f&#xf6;r visselbl&#xe5;sare, s&#xe4;rskilt de som &#xe4;r relaterade till kr&#xe4;nkningar av de m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheterna, samt

st&#xe4;rka &#xf6;ppenheten och ansvarsskyldigheten vid genomf&#xf6;randet av fredsavtalet.

Insatsen kvalificerar som ett Team Sweden-bidrag, eftersom den &#xe4;r kopplad till verifierade svenska aff&#xe4;rsintressen genom samarbeten med Electrolux, SKF, Securitas och AstraZeneca. Tillsammans fr&#xe4;mjar de f&#xf6;retagsintegritet, ansvarsfullt f&#xf6;retagande och st&#xe4;rker Team Swedens synlighet i Colombia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project support for Transparencia por Colombia (the recognized local chapter of Transparency International) aims at improving control over public administration to make it more transparent, responsible, and oriented towards peacebuilding and the common good, by:

Advocating for increased transparency, responsibility, and equality in the access to public administration.

Monitoring the control exerted by the judicial system and independent control bodies over the public administration in corruption cases.

Fostering the appropriation of the public sphere by the citizenry and advocating for more effective protection mechanisms for whistle-blowers, especially those related to human rights violations.

Strengthening transparency and accountability in the implementation of the Peace Agreement.

This contribution qualifies as a Team Sweden Contribution, as it is linked to verified Swedish business interests through collaboration with Electrolux, SKF, Securitas, and AstraZeneca to promote corporate integrity, responsible business conduct, and visibility of Team Sweden in Colombia.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the intervention is to contribute, from civil society, to improve oversight of public administration in Colombia to make it more transparent, responsible and oriented towards peacebuilding and the common good.
For achieving this goal, four specific objectives have been drawn up:
1. To advocate for increased transparency, responsibility and equality in the access to public administration;
2. To monitor the control exerted by the judicial system and independent control bodies over the exercise of public power in corruption cases;
3. To foster the appropriation of the public sphere by the citizenry and advocate for more effective protection mechanisms for whistleblowers, in particular those related to human rights violations;
4. To strengthen transparency and accountability in the implementation of the Peace Agreement.</narrative>
  </description>
